  "title": "Big Ray's Kielbasa Cabbage Skillet for a Crowd",
  "description": "Big Ray's kielbasa cabbage skillet for a crowd recipe includes Polish sausage, cabbage, and potato. The skillet dinner is great for camping or potlucks.",
